    "detailed_description": "<h1>Web version for free</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >image2pixel.app</p></p><br><h1>About the Software</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image2pixel is a pixel painting generation tool that can convert input images into pixel-style images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The software is suitable for pixel art enthusiasts, pixel art beginners with zero art foundation, and independent pixel art game developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main functions</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input images to view pixel painting effects in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust pixel size and color number parameters to get the best effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support importing custom color palette files (supports act format)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports conversion of gif images, which can quickly generate emoticons or meme gifs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports inputting Google Gemini API Key, text-to-image generation</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image2pixel is a pixel painting generation tool that can convert input images into pixel-style images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The software is suitable for pixel art enthusiasts, pixel art beginners with zero art foundation, and independent pixel art game developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main functions</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input images to view pixel painting effects in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust pixel size and color number parameters to get the best effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support importing custom color palette files (supports act format)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports conversion of gif images, which can quickly generate emoticons or meme gifs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports inputting Google Gemini API Key, text-to-image generation</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Image2pixel is a professional pixel art generator that transforms regular images into beautiful pixel-style artwork. Whether you're a game developer, artist, or content creator, you can easily create the pixel art you envision.",
